---

# Flashing

Flash the generated ZIP using **TWRP**.

Before flashing it is highly recommended to:

- Backup your Boot partition
- Backup important data
- Keep a copy of your previous kernel
- Know how to recover your device using TWRP or Odin

---

# Building

Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/emiliaplays/GlitchCore-KRNL.git
cd GlitchCore-KRNL
```

Build for Galaxy Note10+:

```bash
./build.sh --model d2s --ksu y
```

Supported models:

```
beyond0lte
beyond1lte
beyond2lte
beyondx

d1
d1xks
d2s
d2x
d2xks
```

