# Upcoming Changes

The following improvements are currently planned for future releases.

Development priorities may change depending on stability, testing, and community feedback.

## Planned for v1.1

- Fix KernelSU support
- Remove `openela-rc1` from the kernel version string
- Improve installer reliability
- General source cleanup

## Planned for v1.2

- Performance optimizations
- UFS optimizations
- Scheduler improvements
- ZRAM tuning
- Memory management improvements

## Planned Features

- Optional CPU overclock
- Optional GPU overclock
- Thermal profiles
- Additional CPU governors
- Additional I/O schedulers
- More One UI 7 optimizations
- Additional performance tuning

